  "description": "Sheriff Cowboy is a bold and classic display typeface inspired by old west signage, cowboy culture, and vintage Americana design. Featuring strong slab-style letterforms with a rugged and timeless feel, this font is perfect for creating eye-catching western-themed designs. Ideal for logos, posters, branding, apparel, packaging, badges, and rustic projects. Its bold presence and authentic western character make it a great choice for designs that need a strong, vintage cowboy aesthetic.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Sheriff Cowboy is a bold and classic display typeface inspired by old west signage, cowboy culture, and vintage Americana design. Featuring strong slab-style letterforms with a rugged and timeless feel, this font is perfect for creating eye-catching western-themed designs. Ideal for logos, posters, branding, apparel, packaging, badges, and rustic projects. Its bold presence and authentic western character make it a great choice for designs that need a strong, vintage cowboy aesthetic.</p>",
